// Camera Security Lab — Firebase Storage is NOT used by this project.
//
// Firebase Storage requires the paid "Blaze" plan even for small personal
// projects, so captured photos/videos/live-frames are uploaded to
// Cloudinary instead (an UNSIGNED upload preset — see
// app/src/main/java/com/testlab/camerasec/cloudinary/CloudinaryUploader.kt).
// Cloudinary's own upload preset settings act as its access control, not
// these rules.
//
// This file is kept only so the repo's history/structure makes it obvious
// Storage was deliberately skipped, not forgotten. There is nothing to
// deploy here — do not paste this into the Firebase Console's Storage
// Rules tab; leave your existing Storage rules (for your other apps)
// untouched.
